<title>UK: Lehman Brothers sets warrants on UK biotech basket.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers sets warrants on UK biotech basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance SA says it has issued four million American-style call warrants, on the Lehman Brothers UK Biotech basket, comprising British Biotech Plc, Biocompatibles Plc and Celltech Plc.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    100.00 GBP		PREMIUM	19.50 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.95 GBP		  GEARING	5.13 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   17.FEB.98		 PAYDATE	10.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  100.00 GBP</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  LBWTS18</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
